---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import T from "../components/i18n/T.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="아이티모스 ITMOSS — Engineering the Media Future."
  description="아이티모스(ITMOSS)는 Vision AI와 블록체인 기술로 뷰티 정밀 분석과 디지털 초상권 인프라를 개발하는 딥테크 브랜드입니다."
  keywords="아이티모스, ITMOSS, Vision AI, 뷰티 AI, 블록체인, 딥테크, 디지털 초상권, haepick, JVL, JIS"
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ══════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="gradient-hero min-h-[90vh] flex items-center">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 sm:py-24 w-full">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center">

        <div>

          <T tag="h1" class="hero-title mt-5 text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl xl:text-7xl font-black tracking-tight leading-[1.08]"
            en={`Engineering<br /><span class="gradient-text">the Media</span><br />Future.`}
            ko={`미디어의 미래를<br /><span class="gradient-text">엔지니어링</span><br />합니다.`}
            vi={`Kiến tạo<br /><span class="gradient-text">Tương lai</span><br />Truyền thông.`}
            th={`วิศวกรรม<br /><span class="gradient-text">อนาคต</span><br />สื่อ.`}
            bn={`মিডিয়ার ভবিষ্যৎ<br /><span class="gradient-text">নির্মাণ</span><br />করছি.`}
            ja={`メディアの<br /><span class="gradient-text">未来を</span><br />エンジニアリング。`}
            zh={`工程化<br /><span class="gradient-text">媒体</span><br />未来。`}
          />
          <T tag="p" class="hero-sub mt-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-500 leading-relaxed max-w-md" 
            en={`ITMOSS builds deep-tech infrastructure that brings <strong class="text-slate-700">precision beauty analysis</strong> and <strong class="text-slate-700">digital portrait rights</strong> to life — powered by Vision AI and blockchain convergence.`}
            ko={`ITMOSS는 비전 AI와 블록체인 융합을 통해 <strong class="text-slate-700">정밀 뷰티 분석</strong>과 <strong class="text-slate-700">디지털 초상권</strong>을 실현하는 딥테크 인프라를 구축합니다.`}
            vi={`ITMOSS xây dựng cơ sở hạ tầng công nghệ sâu mang đến <strong class="text-slate-700">phân tích sắc đẹp chính xác</strong> và <strong class="text-slate-700">quyền chân dung kỹ thuật số</strong> — được hỗ trợ bởi Vision AI và chuỗi khối.`}
            th={`ITMOSS สร้างโครงสร้างพื้นฐานระดับลึกที่นำ <strong class="text-slate-700">การวิเคราะห์ความงามที่แม่นยำ</strong> และ <strong class="text-slate-700">สิทธิ์ภาพพอร์ตเทรตดิจิทัล</strong> สู่ชีวิต`}
            bn={`ITMOSS একটি গভীর-প্রযুক্তি পরিকাঠামো তৈরি করে যা <strong class="text-slate-700">دقيق সৌন্দর্য বিশ্লেষণ</strong> নিয়ে আসে।`}
            ja={`ITMOSSは、Vision AIとブロックチェーンの融合により、<strong class="text-slate-700">精密な美容分析</strong>と<strong class="text-slate-700">デジタル肖像権</strong>を実現するディープテックインフラを構築します。`}
            zh={`ITMOSS构建深层技术基础设施，通过Vision AI和区块链的融合，将<strong class="text-slate-700">精确的美容分析</strong>和<strong class="text-slate-700">数字肖像权</strong>变为现实。`}
          />
          <div class="hero-cta mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="#solutions" class="btn btn-primary">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group text-xs"></i>
              Explore Stack
            </a>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">
              <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope text-xs"></i>
              Collaborate
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-image flex justify-center mt-8 lg:mt-0">
          <div class="relative w-full max-w-sm lg:max-w-md">
            <div class="absolute -inset-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-100 to-pink-100 rounded-3xl blur-2xl opacity-60"></div>
            <img
              src="/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_prkgjxprkgjxprkg.png"
              alt="ITMOSS — Engineering the Media Future."
              class="relative w-full h-auto object-contain rounded-2xl"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <div class="mt-12 sm:mt-16 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 sm:gap-4">
        {[
          {
            icon: "fa-solid fa-microscope",
            label: { en: "Vision AI",      ko: "비전 AI",       vi: "Vision AI",              th: "Vision AI",                  bn: "ভিশন AI",         ja: "Vision AI",          zh: "视觉AI" },
            desc:  { en: "Battle-Tested Stack", ko: "검증된 기술 스택", vi: "Stack đã kiểm nghiệm", th: "Stack ที่ผ่านการทดสอบ", bn: "পরীক্ষিত স্ট্যাক", ja: "実証済みスタック",  zh: "久经考验的技术栈" },
          },
          {
            icon: "fa-solid fa-link",
            label: { en: "Blockchain",     ko: "블록체인",       vi: "Blockchain",             th: "บล็อกเชน",                   bn: "ব্লকচেইন",        ja: "ブロックチェーン",    zh: "区块链" },
            desc:  { en: "Kaia / Avalanche", ko: "Kaia / Avalanche", vi: "Kaia / Avalanche",  th: "Kaia / Avalanche",           bn: "Kaia / Avalanche", ja: "Kaia / Avalanche", zh: "Kaia / Avalanche" },
          },
          {
            icon: "fa-solid fa-cubes",
            label: { en: "2 Platforms",    ko: "플랫폼",    vi: "2 Nền tảng",             th: "2 แพลตฟอร์ม",                bn: "২টি প্ল্যাটফর্ম", ja: "2プラットフォーム", zh: "2个平台" },
            desc:  { en: "Identity Shield · Beauty AI", ko: "초상권 보호 · 뷰티 AI", vi: "Identity Shield · Beauty AI", th: "Identity Shield · Beauty AI", bn: "পরিচয় সুরক্ষা · বিউটি AI", ja: "Identity Shield · Beauty AI", zh: "身份盾牌 · 美妆AI" },
          },
          {
            icon: "fa-solid fa-chart-line",
            label: { en: "Field Verified", ko: "현장 검증",      vi: "Đã xác minh",            th: "ผ่านการทดสอบ",               bn: "ফিল্ড ভেরিফাইড", ja: "フィールド検証済み", zh: "现场验证" },
            desc:  { en: "Global Leads",   ko: "글로벌 리드",    vi: "Dẫn đầu toàn cầu",       th: "นำตลาดโลก",                  bn: "গ্লোবাল লিড",    ja: "グローバルリード",  zh: "全球潜在客户" },
          },
        ].map((s) => (
          <div class="bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-3 sm:p-5 border border-white/80 text-center">
            <i class={`${s.icon} text-xl sm:text-2xl text-indigo-500 mb-1.5`}></i>
            <T tag="p" class="font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800" en={s.label.en} ko={s.label.ko} vi={s.label.vi} th={s.label.th} bn={s.label.bn} ja={s.label.ja} zh={s.label.zh} />
            <T tag="p" class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5" en={s.desc.en} ko={s.desc.ko} vi={s.desc.vi} th={s.desc.th} bn={s.desc.bn} ja={s.desc.ja} zh={s.desc.zh} />
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════
       SOLUTIONS
  ══════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="solutions" class="py-20 sm:py-32 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">

      <div class="text-center mb-12 sm:mb-20 reveal">
        <p class="section-label">SOLUTIONS</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight mt-2">ITMOSS Stack</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-500 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Real services are born on top of our proprietary solution stack.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-5 sm:space-y-6">

        <!-- JIS · Identity Shield (first) -->
        <div id="identity-shield" class="reveal card overflow-hidden p-0">
          <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-0">
            <div class="p-6 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-center border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-slate-100">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
                <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-pink-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-pink-200">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-fingerprint text-white text-base"></i>
                </div>
                <span class="badge badge-pink">JIS · Identity Shield</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-1">
                <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black font-mono text-pink-500 tracking-tight">JIS</span>
                <sup class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-bold">™</sup>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black mb-1 text-slate-800">Jaster Identity Shield<sup class="text-xs text-pink-400 ml-0.5">™</sup></h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-pink-500 font-semibold tracking-widest mb-1 uppercase">Uzudebris Protocol</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4">Legal-Tech · Blockchain</p>
              <T tag="p" class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5"
                en="Portrait rights valuation and protection protocol.<br />Legal-Tech for influencers, artists, and MCN entertainment companies."
                ko="초상권 가치 평가 및 보호 프로토콜.<br />인플루언서, 아티스트, MCN 엔터테인먼트 기업을 위한 Legal-Tech."
                vi="Giao thức định giá và bảo vệ quyền chân dung.<br />Legal-Tech cho influencer, nghệ sĩ và công ty giải trí MCN."
                th="โปรโตคอลการประเมินมูลค่าและปกป้องสิทธิ์ภาพพอร์ตเทรต<br />Legal-Tech สำหรับ influencer, ศิลปิน และบริษัทบันเทิง MCN"
                bn="পোট্রেট রাইটস মূল্যায়ন ও সুরক্ষা প্রোটোকল।<br />ইনফ্লুয়েন্সার, শিল্পী এবং MCN এন্টারটেইনমেন্ট কোম্পানির জন্য Legal-Tech।"
                ja="肖像権の評価と保護プロトコル。<br />インフルエンサー、アーティスト、MCNエンターテインメント企業向けLegal-Tech。"
                zh="肖像权估值与保护协议。<br />为网红、艺术家和MCN娱乐公司提供的Legal-Tech。"
              />
              <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-pink-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
                  <T tag="span" class="text-slate-600"
                    en={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Valuation Calculator</strong> — Converts portrait rights into economic value via viral views & CPM`}
                    ko={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Valuation Calculator</strong> — 바이럴 조회수 & CPM을 통해 초상권을 경제적 가치로 환산`}
                    vi={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Máy tính định giá</strong> — Chuyển đổi quyền chân dung thành giá trị kinh tế qua lượt xem viral & CPM`}
                    th={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Valuation Calculator</strong> — แปลงสิทธิ์ภาพพอร์ตเทรตเป็นมูลค่าทางเศรษฐกิจผ่าน viral views & CPM`}
                    bn={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Valuation Calculator</strong> — ভাইরাল ভিউ ও CPM-এর মাধ্যমে পোট্রেট রাইটসকে অর্থনৈতিক মূল্যে রূপান্তর`}
                    ja={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Valuation Calculator</strong> — バイラルビューとCPMを通じて肖像権を経済的価値に変換`}
                    zh={`<strong class="text-slate-800">估值计算器</strong> — 通过病毒式观看量和CPM将肖像权转化为经济价值`}
                  />
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-pink-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
                  <T tag="span" class="text-slate-600"
                    en={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Hybrid Blockchain</strong> — Permanent Hash preservation on Kaia/Avalanche mainnet`}
                    ko={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Hybrid Blockchain</strong> — Kaia/Avalanche 메인넷에 영구 Hash 보존`}
                    vi={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Blockchain lai</strong> — Bảo tồn Hash vĩnh viễn trên mainnet Kaia/Avalanche`}
                    th={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Hybrid Blockchain</strong> — การอนุรักษ์ Hash ถาวรบน Kaia/Avalanche mainnet`}
                    bn={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Hybrid Blockchain</strong> — Kaia/Avalanche মেইননেটে স্থায়ী Hash সংরক্ষণ`}
                    ja={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Hybrid Blockchain</strong> — Kaia/Avalanche メインネット上の永続的なHash保存`}
                    zh={`<strong class="text-slate-800">混合区块链</strong> — 在Kaia/Avalanche主网上永久保存Hash`}
                  />
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-pink-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
                  <T tag="span" class="text-slate-600"
                    en={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Zero-Image Policy</strong> — Original image disposal with vector-based security management`}
                    ko={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Zero-Image Policy</strong> — 원본 이미지 폐기 및 벡터 기반 보안 관리`}
                    vi={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Chính sách Zero-Image</strong> — Xử lý ảnh gốc với quản lý bảo mật dựa trên vector`}
                    th={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Zero-Image Policy</strong> — การจัดการรูปภาพต้นฉบับด้วยการจัดการความปลอดภัยแบบ vector`}
                    bn={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Zero-Image Policy</strong> — মূল ছবি মুছে ফেলা এবং ভেক্টর-ভিত্তিক নিরাপত্তা ব্যবস্থাপনা`}
                    ja={`<strong class="text-slate-800">Zero-Image Policy</strong> — ベクターベースのセキュリティ管理による元画像の廃棄`}
                    zh={`<strong class="text-slate-800">零图像策略</strong> — 基于向量的安全管理，废弃原始图像`}
                  />
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <!-- JIS Visual: Face Scan -->
            <div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-pink-950 min-h-[280px] flex items-center justify-center">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10"
                style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(236,72,153,0.4) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(236,72,153,0.4) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 28px 28px;"></div>
              <div class="relative text-center px-6 sm:px-8 py-10 sm:py-12">
                <div class="relative w-28 h-28 mx-auto mb-5">
                  <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border-2 border-dashed border-pink-500/40 animate-spin" style="animation-duration:8s;"></div>
                  <div class="absolute inset-2 rounded-full border border-pink-400/30" style="animation: pulse-ring 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;"></div>
                  <div class="absolute inset-4 rounded-full bg-pink-500/15 border border-pink-400/40 flex items-center justify-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-face-smile-beam text-3xl text-pink-300"></i>
                  </div>
                  <div class="absolute top-1 left-1 w-4 h-4 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-pink-400 rounded-tl"></div>
                  <div class="absolute top-1 right-1 w-4 h-4 border-t-2 border-r-2 border-pink-400 rounded-tr"></div>
                  <div class="absolute bottom-1 left-1 w-4 h-4 border-b-2 border-l-2 border-pink-400 rounded-bl"></div>
                  <div class="absolute bottom-1 right-1 w-4 h-4 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-pink-400 rounded-br"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-pink-500/20 border border-pink-500/30 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-3">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-pink-400 animate-pulse"></span>
                  <span class="text-pink-300 text-xs font-mono tracking-widest">IDENTITY PROTECTED</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-white font-black text-lg mb-1">Uzudebris<sup class="text-pink-400 text-xs ml-0.5">™</sup></p>
                <T tag="p" class="text-pink-300/70 text-xs mb-4"
                  en="Portrait Rights Protection Protocol"
                  ko="초상권 보호 프로토콜"
                  vi="Giao thức bảo vệ quyền chân dung"
                  th="โปรโตคอลคุ้มครองสิทธิ์ภาพพอร์ตเทรต"
                  bn="পোট্রেট রাইটস সুরক্ষা প্রোটোকল"
                  ja="肖像権保護プロトコル"
                  zh="肖像权保护协议"
                />
                <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2">
                  <span class="bg-pink-500/20 text-pink-300 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-pink-500/30">Kaia</span>
                  <span class="bg-pink-500/20 text-pink-300 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-pink-500/30">Avalanche</span>
                  <span class="bg-pink-500/20 text-pink-300 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-pink-500/30">Zero-Image</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Beauty AI Platform (umbrella, new) -->
        <div id="beauty-ai-platform" class="reveal card overflow-hidden p-0">
          <!-- Top: description + engine highlights + image -->
          <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-0">
            <div class="p-6 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-center border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-slate-100">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
                <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles text-white text-base"></i>
                </div>
                <span class="badge badge-indigo">Beauty AI Platform</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black mb-1 text-slate-800">Beauty AI Platform</h3>
              <T tag="p" class="text-xs text-indigo-500 font-semibold tracking-widest mb-4 uppercase"
                en="Powered by JVL + JMI engine"
                ko="JVL + JMI 엔진 기반"
                vi="Được hỗ trợ bởi JVL + JMI engine"
                th="ขับเคลื่อนโดย JVL + JMI engine"
                bn="JVL + JMI ইঞ্জিন দ্বারা চালিত"
                ja="JVL + JMI エンジン搭載"
                zh="由 JVL + JMI 引擎驱动"
              />
              <T tag="p" class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6"
                en="One Vision-AI engine, broken into functional products for K-beauty brands and retailers."
                ko="K-뷰티 브랜드와 리테일러를 위한 AI 마케팅 플랫폼."
                vi="Một engine Vision-AI được phân chia thành các sản phẩm chức năng cho các thương hiệu K-beauty và nhà bán lẻ."
                th="Vision-AI engine เดียว แบ่งเป็นผลิตภัณฑ์เชิงฟังก์ชันสำหรับแบรนด์ K-beauty และผู้ค้าปลีก"
                bn="একটি ভিশন-AI ইঞ্জিন, K-বিউটি ব্র্যান্ড ও খুচরা বিক্রেতাদের জন্য কার্যকরী পণ্যে বিভক্ত।"
                ja="K-beautyブランドと小売業者向けに、1つのVision-AIエンジンを機能別製品に分割したプラットフォーム。"
